---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | LOCA" description="How LOCA handles personal data submitted through this website.">
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl article-body reveal">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-loca-dark mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg">
        The Local Community Action Alliance (LOCA) respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal data
        this website collects and how it is used.
      </p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use our contact form, we collect the name, email address, subject and message you provide. This
        information is used only to respond to your enquiry and is processed on our behalf by a third-party form
        service. This website does not use advertising trackers or sell personal data.
      </p>
      <h2>Confidential feedback and complaints</h2>
      <p>
        Feedback and complaints, including safeguarding and PSEA concerns, are handled confidentially and only
        shared with the staff members responsible for following them up, with protection against retaliation.
      </p>
      <h2>Data retention and your rights</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry data only as long as needed to handle your request and our legitimate record-keeping
        obligations. You may ask us to access, correct or delete personal data you have shared by emailing
        info@localliance.org.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
